[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9781.03, "timestamp": "02:43:01", "text": "父母"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9783.03, "timestamp": "02:43:03", "text": "比如，这到底是什么？子女抚养费？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9784.95, "timestamp": "02:43:04", "text": "类似某种东西或系统之类的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9786.87, "timestamp": "02:43:06", "text": "正确的？我不知道。我不太了解。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9790.71, "timestamp": "02:43:10", "text": "关于它。但是，是啊，我当时就想，哇，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9793.11, "timestamp": "02:43:13", "text": "你18岁就可以搬出去住了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9795.83, "timestamp": "02:43:15", "text": "就像学习生活一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9799.51, "timestamp": "02:43:19", "text": "真是太不可思议了。而我们没有那个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9802.79, "timestamp": "02:43:22", "text": "这里是系统。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9805.03, "timestamp": "02:43:25", "text": "我们这里没有那套系统。自由"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9807.349, "timestamp": "02:43:27", "text": "或者说，不是自由，而是更像自由"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9810.309, "timestamp": "02:43:30", "text": "探索生活以及它所面临的挑战"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9814.87, "timestamp": "02:43:34", "text": "生活终将如此，一切亦如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9817.75, "timestamp": "02:43:37", "text": "大多数人在178岁以后就搬走了。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9824.95, "timestamp": "02:43:44", "text": "但这里的情况并非如此。莫"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9829.269, "timestamp": "02:43:49", "text": "会搬出去。不，大多数人永远不会。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9832.55, "timestamp": "02:43:52", "text": "是的，有些人永远不会搬出去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9834.87, "timestamp": "02:43:54", "text": "即使如此，他们仍然会和父母在一起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9837.429, "timestamp": "02:43:57", "text": "结婚之后等等"}]